Difference Between Class Diagram and Deployment Diagram
Class Diagram	Deployment Diagram
Shows software structure	Shows physical architecture
Focuses on classes	Focuses on hardware/software deployment
Static logical view	Static physical view
Used in design	Used in deployment planning
Steps to Draw Deployment Diagram
Identify hardware devices

Identify software components

Place artifacts on nodes

Connect nodes with communication paths

Add execution environments if needed

